    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\">\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><b>LAGOS</b>&nbsp;(Chunky)</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><i>Mexican Oak</i></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><i>Finishes: Bleached &amp; Natural</i></div>\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Lagos Rectangle Dining Table</div>\n\n<div>\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Lagos Rectangle 120\" Dining Table</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Lagos Rectangle 108\" Dining Table</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Lagos Coffee Table (14/15\" H)</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Lagos Rectangle Coffee</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Lagos Square Coffee</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Lagos Side Table (needs to also double as a nightstand)</div>\n\n<div>Lagos 90\" Closed Sideboard</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Lagos 90\" Open Sideboard</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Lagos Bed (HB only/Platform)</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Lagos Queen Bed</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Lagos King Bed</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Lagos Mirrors (how thick the frame is determines the mirror size- sizes below are based on 4.5\" outside wood frame)</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n\n<blockquote>Lagos Wall - 30 x 40\"&nbsp;</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>Lagos Floor Length - 28 x 76\"</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>*Lagos Sofa and side chair will be Phase II</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</div>\n</div>"
    },
