    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\">\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><b>TIERRA</b>&nbsp;(Live Edge)</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><i>Yuka Wood</i></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><i>Finishes: Natural &amp; Black</i></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><i>Bookmatch Veneer</i></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><i>Engineered Live Edge</i></div>\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">Tiera Dining Tables:</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Tierra Rectangle 120\" Dining Table</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Tierra Round 60\" Dining Table</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Tierra Coffee Tables:</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Tierra 60\" Rectangle Coffee</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Tierra 36-48\" Round Coffee</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">Tierra Side Tables (both need to work as nightstands):\n\n<blockquote>Tierra Square Side\n<div>Tierra Round Side</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Tierra Console</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Tierra Console 60\"</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Tierra Console 72\"</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>Tierra Bed (HB only/Platform)</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Tierra Queen Bed</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>Tierra King Bed</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>*Version with metal legs to be Phase II</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"af039df5-d630-4a60-8abe-ee4de5762086\"></attachment><attachment id=\"5b7d2c62-1